*> Single owner of every counter. Callers pass an operation code and never touch
*> a counter directly. Cohort index 0 means "total". Every accumulation uses ON
*> SIZE ERROR and reports status 1, which MAIN turns into abort cause ACCSIZE.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LEDGER.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY CAPS.
COPY LEDGER.
01 LG-TABLE.
   05 LG-ROW OCCURS 65.
      10 LG-READ PIC 9(9) COMP-5.
      10 LG-WRIT PIC 9(9) COMP-5.
      10 LG-REJT PIC 9(9) COMP-5.
      10 LG-HELD PIC 9(9) COMP-5.
      10 LG-LAB PIC S9(13)V99.
      10 LG-HASH PIC 9(10).
01 LG-CTRL PIC 9(9) COMP-5.
01 LG-WARN PIC 9(9) COMP-5.
01 LG-ROWS PIC 9(9) COMP-5 OCCURS 4.
01 WS-X PIC 9(3) COMP-5.
01 WS-LO PIC 9(3) COMP-5.
01 WS-HI PIC 9(3) COMP-5.
01 WS-PASSED PIC 9(9) COMP-5.
01 WS-HASHSUM PIC 9(11).
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LK-OP PIC X(8).
01 LK-COH PIC 9(3).
01 LK-AMOUNT PIC S9(13)V99.
01 LK-STATUS PIC 9.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-OP LK-COH LK-AMOUNT LK-STATUS.
MAIN-PARA.
    MOVE 0 TO LK-STATUS
    COMPUTE WS-X = LK-COH + 1
    EVALUATE LK-OP
        WHEN LG-RESET PERFORM DO-RESET
        WHEN LG-ADDREAD
            ADD 1 TO LG-READ(WS-X) LG-READ(1) ON SIZE ERROR MOVE 1 TO LK-STATUS
        WHEN LG-MARKREJT
            ADD 1 TO LG-REJT(WS-X) LG-REJT(1) ON SIZE ERROR MOVE 1 TO LK-STATUS
        WHEN LG-MARKWRIT PERFORM DO-SETTLE-WRIT
        WHEN LG-MARKHELD PERFORM DO-SETTLE-HELD
        WHEN LG-ADDCTRL ADD 1 TO LG-CTRL ON SIZE ERROR MOVE 1 TO LK-STATUS
        WHEN LG-ADDWARN ADD 1 TO LG-WARN ON SIZE ERROR MOVE 1 TO LK-STATUS
        WHEN LG-ADDROW
            *> Cohort field carries the CSV kind 1-4; amount carries the row count.
            ADD LK-AMOUNT TO LG-ROWS(LK-COH) ON SIZE ERROR MOVE 1 TO LK-STATUS
        WHEN LG-ADDLAB
            ADD LK-AMOUNT TO LG-LAB(WS-X) LG-LAB(1) ON SIZE ERROR MOVE 1 TO LK-STATUS
        WHEN LG-ADDHASH PERFORM DO-ADDHASH
        WHEN LG-CHKIDENT PERFORM DO-CHKIDENT
        WHEN LG-GETREAD MOVE LG-READ(WS-X) TO LK-AMOUNT
        WHEN LG-GETWRIT MOVE LG-WRIT(WS-X) TO LK-AMOUNT
        WHEN LG-GETREJT MOVE LG-REJT(WS-X) TO LK-AMOUNT
        WHEN LG-GETHELD MOVE LG-HELD(WS-X) TO LK-AMOUNT
        WHEN LG-GETCTRL MOVE LG-CTRL TO LK-AMOUNT
        WHEN LG-GETWARN MOVE LG-WARN TO LK-AMOUNT
        WHEN LG-GETROWS MOVE LG-ROWS(LK-COH) TO LK-AMOUNT
        WHEN LG-GETLAB MOVE LG-LAB(WS-X) TO LK-AMOUNT
        WHEN LG-GETHASH MOVE LG-HASH(WS-X) TO LK-AMOUNT
        WHEN OTHER MOVE 1 TO LK-STATUS
    END-EVALUATE
    GOBACK.

DO-RESET.
    INITIALIZE LG-TABLE
    MOVE 0 TO LG-CTRL LG-WARN
    PERFORM VARYING WS-X FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-X > 4
        MOVE 0 TO LG-ROWS(WS-X)
    END-PERFORM.

*> Written and held are derived from read-rejected, so marking twice is harmless
*> and the identity read = written + rejected + held holds by construction only
*> when every cohort is settled (checked by CHKIDENT).
DO-SETTLE-WRIT.
    COMPUTE WS-PASSED = LG-READ(WS-X) - LG-REJT(WS-X)
    COMPUTE LG-WRIT(1) = LG-WRIT(1) - LG-WRIT(WS-X) + WS-PASSED
    MOVE WS-PASSED TO LG-WRIT(WS-X).

DO-SETTLE-HELD.
    COMPUTE WS-PASSED = LG-READ(WS-X) - LG-REJT(WS-X)
    COMPUTE LG-HELD(1) = LG-HELD(1) - LG-HELD(WS-X) + WS-PASSED
    MOVE WS-PASSED TO LG-HELD(WS-X).

DO-ADDHASH.
    *> Reduce mod 10^10 after every addition, like the exporter's hash total.
    COMPUTE LG-HASH(WS-X) = FUNCTION MOD(LG-HASH(WS-X) + LK-AMOUNT, 10000000000)
    COMPUTE LG-HASH(1) = FUNCTION MOD(LG-HASH(1) + LK-AMOUNT, 10000000000).

DO-CHKIDENT.
    IF LK-COH = 0
        MOVE 1 TO WS-LO
        MOVE 65 TO WS-HI
    ELSE
        MOVE WS-X TO WS-LO
        MOVE WS-X TO WS-HI
    END-IF
    PERFORM VARYING WS-X FROM WS-LO BY 1 UNTIL WS-X > WS-HI
        IF LG-READ(WS-X) NOT = LG-WRIT(WS-X) + LG-REJT(WS-X) + LG-HELD(WS-X)
            MOVE 1 TO LK-STATUS
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM.
